WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.070
622.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:06.040
Two men hide in a cave
near Makkah for three days.

3
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.040
The city's leaders plotted
to kill one of them.

4
00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:13.940
Eight years later, that same city
surrenders to him almost without fighting.

5
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:18.670
The idols in the Ka'bah are destroyed,
and his old enemies are forgiven.

6
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.140
So how did a man who fled by night
come back as the city's leader?

7
00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.120
In this mission, you'll
follow his escape north,

8
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.750
the journey Muslims
count their years from.

9
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.270
Then you'll look at the
roles he took on there:

10
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:35.000
religious, moral, political and military.

11
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:40.120
Your mission: find out how he went from
fugitive to leader of the city he fled.
